Notes:
- [1] https://github.com/feathericons/feather. Implementation is currently using the [`Client-side JavaScript`](https://github.com/feathericons/feather?tab=readme-ov-file#client-side-javascript) method but I Don't Like JavaScript:tm:, so this may be changed to some form of local install or npm solution as also detailed in their README, later. Although I also don't like npm because I haven't used it ever, it's a black box to me haha. Downside to a local install, though, is the icons won't be visible in the `/templates` folder -- only when generated to the `/public` folder.
- [2] each new stat line inserted by {{OtherSocials}} should be of the form: 
```html
<div class="author-stat">
  <p>
    <i data-feather="link"></i>
    {{LinkName}}: {{Link}}
  </p>
</div>
```
- [3] each new article inserted by {{AuthorPrevArticles}} should be of the form: 
```html
<div class="author-profile-article"">
  <img src="{{ArticleCoverImage}}" style="max-width: 100px;" class="float-start imgshadow me-3" alt="{{ArticleCoverImageAltText}}">
  <p>
    <strong><a href="{{ArticleLink}}">{{ArticleTitle}}</a></strong> &#8212; <em>{{ArticleType}}</em> &#8212; <em>{{ArticleDate}}</em> &#8212;
    {{ArticleDescription}}
  </p>
</div>
```
